msgid "Joint Protection Bones"
msgstr "Joint Protection Bones"

msgid "Select bones for Preserve Joint Transitions. This selection is independent of border preservation. No selected bones means no joint-transition protection."
msgstr "Select bones for Preserve Joint Transitions. This selection is independent of border preservation. No selected bones means no joint-transition protection."

msgid "Keeps the source vertex rings where the strongest bone influence changes, plus one surrounding ring. Other regions can still simplify. Cascading entries use Joint Protection Bones; standalone simplifiers protect all joints. Independent of the bone-weight protection policy. May stop above the triangle target; test animated poses."
msgstr "Keeps the source vertex rings where the strongest bone influence changes, plus one surrounding ring. Other regions can still simplify. Cascading entries use Joint Protection Bones; standalone simplifiers protect all joints. Independent of the bone-weight protection policy. May stop above the triangle target; test animated poses."

msgid "Automatically protect deforming meshes"
msgstr "Automatically protect deforming meshes"

msgid "Protects each mesh using multiple bones, including clothing and custom rigs. Does not require a unique body mesh."
msgstr "Protects each mesh using multiple bones, including clothing and custom rigs. Does not require a unique body mesh."

msgid "This saved mesh uses legacy body-only Auto. Toggle Auto off and on to use per-mesh detection, or apply conservative defaults to update all protections."
msgstr "This saved mesh uses legacy body-only Auto. Toggle Auto off and on to use per-mesh detection, or apply conservative defaults to update all protections."

msgid "Apply Conservative Defaults to All Meshes"
msgstr "Apply Conservative Defaults to All Meshes"

msgid "Replaces mesh protection options and joint-bone selections with conservative defaults. Keeps algorithms, triangle targets, and enabled/fixed choices. Undo is supported."
msgstr "Replaces mesh protection options and joint-bone selections with conservative defaults. Keeps algorithms, triangle targets, and enabled/fixed choices. Undo is supported."

msgid "Protection takes priority over the triangle target. Auto Adjust changes allocations, never disables guards. Preview counts may be stale; Analyze NDMF Build verifies the final budget."
msgstr "Protection takes priority over the triangle target. Auto Adjust changes allocations, never disables guards. Preview counts may be stale; Analyze NDMF Build verifies the final budget."

msgid "Last preview: {0} retained {1:N0} triangles; requested {2:N0}. Constraints limited reduction. Run Analyze NDMF Build to verify."
