msgid "Meshia: '{0}' retained {1:N0} triangles (requested {2:N0}). Protection and topology constraints take priority over the target. Adjust another mesh or review this mesh's protections; Meshia will not disable guards automatically."
msgstr "Meshia: '{0}' retained {1:N0} triangles (requested {2:N0}). Protection and topology constraints take priority over the target. Adjust another mesh or review this mesh's protections; Meshia will not disable guards automatically."
